OL,3,GNEWSARegion left 'short-changed' over
OL,4,Astate visit costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police force will need to pick up
OL,7,Fcosts for state visits in Windsor
OL,8,Fdespite repeated calls for more
OL,9,Fgovernment help, a police boss has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FThe Thames Valley's police and crime
OL,13,Fcommissioner Matthew Barber said the
OL,14,Fregion was being "short-changed" and
OL,15,Fthe visits were a "significant drain on
OL,16,Fresources".
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
