OL,3,GNEWSARegion left 'short-changed' over
OL,4,Astate visit costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn March, he said Thames Valley Police
OL,7,F(TVP) would not be paid #900,000 for
OL,8,Fcosts it incurred during Donald Trump's
OL,9,Fvisit to Windsor Castle in September
OL,10,F2025. The Sultan of Oman is due to
OL,11,Fvisit the King next month.
OL,13,FThe Home Office said it had reimbursed
OL,14,FTVP for "additional police costs" for
OL,15,Fprevious visits and would do so for
OL,16,Fothers in the future.
